+# Date: 2026-11-02. Branch: fix/review-severity-rule (HEAD f90877be; src unmodified; line numbers verified on disk today).
+# Rule applied (S1/S2): grade every finding as blocking (CRITICAL / IMPORTANT: wrong, unsafe, incomplete against stated
+# requirements, or unverifiable) or minor (MINOR / LOW: cosmetic, wording, style, optional polish). Only blocking findings
+# fail a review; minor findings are recorded as notes, are not rechecked, and never trigger a fix pass on their own.
+# At the cap, open blocking findings HALT and escalate to the user (cap numbers and at-cap clauses live in cap-edits.yaml).
+# Inputs: .dev/review-severity-rule/sweep/fixloop-hits.tsv (scanner: sweep/fixloop_scan.py),
