+#     matches equals `occurrences` (every row here has occurrences 1).
+#   - No `old` occurrence shares any character position with a cap-edits.yaml `old` occurrence in the same file, so the two
+#     tables apply in either order.
+#   - `new` never contains `old`. After applying: count(old) == 0 and count(new) >= 1 in `file`.
+#   - Multi-line `old` (verdict PASS+FAIL pairs, the agent_template_qa Fix Cycle block, two short anchors) uses YAML "\n"
+#     escapes and lists every spanned line in `lines`.
